    "detailed_description": "Step into the world of K-pop and join the virtual idol group MAVE: on their journey to stardom! MAVE: is a unique virtual K-pop group that you can interact with through our platform. Chat directly with one of the members (TYRA:) to get to know their personalities and witness their rise to fame.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut that's not all \u2013 as a member of MAZE: (the MAVE: fandom), you can create your own mark on the group's success. Use our platform to create your own performance video by adjusting the stage camera for their debut song &quot;PANDORA&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe are committed to providing you with an ever-evolving platform and exciting new content through future updates. So, stay tuned for more features and experiences with MAVE: - The Virtual K-Pop Idol Experience.",
